fact WorkItem(id: "WI-073", description: some(value: "M5 follow-up: Error[T]::raise runtime propagation. WI-050 did not register a handler for Error[?]. Implement: default handler that unwraps args[0] as the error payload and surfaces it as EvalError::Raised { payload: Value }. Downstream catch/handle constructs (future) inspect the payload. Until catch lands, a raised Error aborts evaluation with the payload in the EvalError. Acceptance: integration test calls raise(my_error_value) and asserts the EvalError matches Raised with the expected payload. Depends on WI-050."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-389"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-06-05T10:46:34Z"))
